    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614090/extras/529d189bb38db957a269c28a0823a45c.poster.avif?t=1717420716\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614090/extras/529d189bb38db957a269c28a0823a45c.webm?t=1717420716\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2614090/extras/529d189bb38db957a269c28a0823a45c.mp4?t=1717420716\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In a faraway kingdom, Princess Mati is kidnapped by the Dark Lord Valtur, an evil being with dark powers. However, thanks to a mysterious gadget from the future, the Dark Lord Valtur manages to take compromising photos of the Princess and threatens to spread them throughout the kingdom unless a ransom of one million dollars is paid.<br><br>Desperate, the king of the kingdom decides to entrust a brave warrior, named Kara, with the task of saving Princess Mati and destroying the compromising photos. Kara a young fearless warrior , sets out on the mission, determined to bring peace to the kingdom and save the princess.<br><br>Enter the kingdom of Princess Mati<br>\u2212Top Down gameplay<br>\u2212Many areas to explore <br>\u2212Pictures 18+ to find in the various areas of the map<br>\u2212Side quests <br>\u2212Power ups<br>\u2212Bosses on every level<br>\u2212Retro Chiptune soundtrack",
